    intro: `Aurora SP spiral fabrics are endless belts built from polyester (PET) or PPS monofilament spirals joined by hinge pins — an open, non-tracking structure with high drainage and easy cleaning, equally at home as dryer belts and as filter belts. Two families cover the two duties: <b>without filler yarns</b> for maximum air flow (up to ~1000 CFM) — the open SP-D models 6890 / 9010 for drying and conveying; or <b>with 2–5 filler yarns</b> for higher density and lower permeability (down to ~325 CFM) — the <a href="#fam-spp">spiral press filter belt (SP-P, below)</a> for belt press filtration. See them alongside the whole <a href="/dryer-fabric/">dryer fabric range</a>.`,
